WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:03.102
[smooth jazz playing]

00:00:03.135 --> 00:00:05.905
- WASN'T THAT THE TURN
FOR OUR POLLING STATION?

00:00:05.938 --> 00:00:08.007
- WHY, NO, YOUNG MAN.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:11.544
UH, SEE, WE--WE KNOW
A SHORTER ROUTE TO YOUR--

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:14.047
TO OUR DEMOCRATIC
POLLING STATION.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.215
- YOU KNOW HOW US DEMOCRATS
LIKE A SHORTCUT,

00:00:16.248 --> 00:00:18.885
LIKE GOVERNMENT SPENDING
TO PROP UP THE ECONOMY.

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:22.789
- THERE'S NOTHING MORE WE LOVE
THAN THOSE FEDERAL PROGRAMS.

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.524
- YOU TWO ARE DEMOCRATS,
AREN'T YOU?

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:25.591
- WHAT?

00:00:25.624 --> 00:00:27.160
[both laugh]

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:28.461
- OF COURSE WE ARE.

00:00:28.494 --> 00:00:30.196
- YOU SEE THE COLOR OF OUR SKIN,
DON'T YOU?

00:00:30.229 --> 00:00:32.532
HOW COULD WE
NOT BLINDLY VOTE DEMOCRATIC?

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:34.167
- I MEAN,
THAT WOULD BE RIDICULOUS.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.635
- WHATEVER.

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:37.103
ALL I KNOW IS MY POLLING PLACE
CLOSES IN 15 MINUTES.

00:00:37.136 --> 00:00:38.905
- WHY, THAT WOULD BE TERRIBLE.
- AWFUL.

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:41.274
I MEAN, HOW ARE YOU GOING TO
ELECT TAX-AND-SPEND POLITICIANS

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:43.009
IF YOU CAN'T VOTE?

00:00:43.042 --> 00:00:46.345
- IT'S HARD ENOUGH TO VOTE
WITH ALL THOSE VOTER I.D. LAWS.

00:00:46.378 --> 00:00:47.780
- REPUBLICANS.
- ARGH!

00:00:47.813 --> 00:00:51.117
THOSE GOSH-DARN REPUBLICANS.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.886
- I KNOW. I'M JUST LIKE, "GRR!"
- YEAH, TEN AND TWO, DOUGLAS.

00:00:53.919 --> 00:00:55.388
- RIGHT.
- YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:00:55.421 --> 00:00:57.423
IF THERE WERE ANY REPUBLICANS
HERE, WHOA-HO-HO-OH,

00:00:57.456 --> 00:00:59.125
I'D BE PISSED.

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:00.726
I'D BE ROYALLY PISSED.
- ME TOO. ME TOO.

00:01:00.759 --> 00:01:02.995
- IN FACT, I WOULD TAKE
THEIR HARD-FOUGHT PRINCIPLES,

00:01:03.028 --> 00:01:05.431
AND I'D SHOVE IT
RIGHT UP THEIR KEISTERS.

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:06.866
- OF COURSE YOU WOULD.

00:01:06.899 --> 00:01:10.103
- WE SEEM TO BE DRIVING
IN CIRCLES.

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:12.905
- DON'T WORRY.
WE'RE ALMOST THERE.

00:01:12.938 --> 00:01:14.207
[tires screech]

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:17.243
- LOOK, IT APPEARS
WE'VE HIT SOMEBODY.

00:01:17.276 --> 00:01:19.312
WE SHOULD GET OUT AND HELP HIM.

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:21.747
- OH!
OH, MY LEG!

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:22.815
OH, MY LEG.

00:01:22.848 --> 00:01:24.350
- OOPSY DAISY. OOPSY DAISY.

00:01:24.383 --> 00:01:26.152
- HERE YOU GO.

00:01:26.185 --> 00:01:27.753
- I AM PISSED.

00:01:27.786 --> 00:01:29.856
I AM ROYALLY PISSED.

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:32.758
NOW, ALTHOUGH IT WAS ONLY
THIS ONE MAN'S FAULT,

00:01:32.791 --> 00:01:35.128
I WILL BE USING
ALL OF YOUR TAX DOLLARS

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:36.696
TO GET HEALTHY,

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.731
THANKS TO THE AFFORDABLE
HEALTHCARE ACT.

00:01:38.764 --> 00:01:40.266
- I KNOW IT DOESN'T SEEM FAIR,

00:01:40.299 --> 00:01:42.835
BUT THAT'S SUPPOSEDLY THE LAW
OF THE LAND NOWADAYS.

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:45.338
- THAT'S WHAT I'VE HEARD.
- YOU DON'T LOOK THAT HURT.

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:47.840
- WHY Y'ALL WEARING
THOSE SAME LEATHER JACKETS

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:49.142
AND THOSE DAD JEANS?

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:50.910
- DISPERSE!

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:56.782
[woman gasps]

00:01:56.815 --> 00:01:58.948
- BLACK REPUBLICAN
MOTHER[bleep]!

